			dependencies: ["07202282F20C78E0"]
			description: [
				"Cranking your machines all day is tiring and inefficient. The solution is simple: harness the power of rivers and make yourself a &2water wheel.&r They spin at &28 RPM and generate 32 SU.&r (btw, SU is pretty much tourqe)"
				""
				""
				"注意：水车现在需要&2大片水域&r，并且在河流及衍生生物群系中&2效率更高。&r简单来说，如果水车位于平原生物群系的大片水域中，其工作效率和SU产出将远低于河流生物群系。"
